# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Crayonlark environment: the only 7 variables. Production: Coolify → your resource →
# Environment Variables (paste the output of scripts/gen-env.sh). Local: `make env`.
#
# Paste values only: no quotes, no comments, no spaces.
# Never change them after the first deploy: the database and file storage are locked to them.
#
# Everything optional (AI keys, Telegram, email, Etsy, Pinterest, off-site backup, Amazon tag,
# Turnstile, Umami) is entered in admin → Settings → Integrations, with an on/off switch each.
# The monthly API budget is in admin → Settings too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# openssl rand -hex 32
SECRET_KEY=
# openssl rand -hex 16
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=
# openssl rand -hex 32   (exactly 64 hex chars)
GARAGE_RPC_SECRET=
# openssl rand -hex 24
GARAGE_ADMIN_TOKEN=
# echo GK$(openssl rand -hex 12)   (GK + 24 hex chars)
S3_ACCESS_KEY=
# openssl rand -hex 32   (64 hex chars)
S3_SECRET_KEY=
# openssl rand -hex 24
REVALIDATE_SECRET=
